  "instructions": [
    "Heat the veggie oil in a large wok over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and sauté until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the chicken legs and sear until browned on all sides, about 5-7 minutes.",
    "Add the tomato paste and stir to combine, cooking for 1-2 minutes.",
    "Add the chicken broth, soy sauce, orange juice, cumin, coriander, paprika, and salt. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20-25 minutes or until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "Remove the chicken from the wok and let it rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve the chicken with the braised sauce spooned over the top."
